<div class="chapter_content content" id="7682498_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[HISTORY: Adopted by the Common Council of the City of Albany 7-18-1983 as Ch. XI of the 1983 Code. Amendments noted where applicable.]</div><aside class="chapterrefblock"><h2 class="generalReferencesTitle">GENERAL REFERENCES</h2><div class="para">Building construction — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7681109" href="7681109#7681109">133</a>.</div><div class="para">Commercial standards — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7681582" href="7681582#7681582">151</a>.</div><div class="para">Electricity — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7682166" href="7682166#7682166">171</a>.</div><div class="para">Elevators — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7682319" href="7682319#7682319">175</a>.</div><div class="para">Pollution — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7683870" href="7683870#7683870">267</a>.</div></aside><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


