    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7682524" data-guid="7682524"></div>
        <div id="questions-7682524" data-guid="7682524" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7682524_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">5-15-2017</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 26.31.17</span></span>]</div><div class="para">Any person aggrieved by a decision of the Building Commissioner may appeal such decision to the Board of Zoning Appeals pursuant to Chapter <a class="xref" guid="38067105" href="38067105#38067105">375</a> of the Code of the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7682525 child"
      id="7682525"
      data-guid="7682525"
      data-parent-guid="7682499"
